- Nuh-uh.

26:27.853 --> 26:28.853
Sorry, man.

26:28.887 --> 26:31.265
Supposed to be stuck up in the woods
around here?

26:31.356 --> 26:32.596
I'll tell you this,

26:32.691 --> 26:36.764
Rust had about as sharp an eye for weakness
as I ever seen.

26:44.069 --> 26:45.810
I'll be right back.

26:53.412 --> 26:54.948
It's my bad, boys.

26:55.047 --> 26:57.584
Maybe we got started on
the wrong foot there.

26:57.649 --> 26:58.650
Aah!

27:02.588 --> 27:03.965
Aah!

27:05.090 --> 27:07.263
You remember
where that little whorehouse is?

27:23.408 --> 27:25.319
Take 353 south.

27:25.410 --> 27:27.754
Gotta exit off the shoulder
before we get to the 14.

27:27.813 --> 27:31.454
From there, we take a din fishing road
to Bayou Chenault.

27:33.485 --> 27:34.589
Okay.

28:11.557 --> 28:12.797
HART; That it?

28:14.159 --> 28:15.467
Mmm-hmm.

28:30.642 --> 28:32.178
Cop car, y'all.

28:33.312 --> 28:35.690
Whose turn is it for the freebie?

28:46.758 --> 28:49.932
I don't do no cops.
That's on you guys, remember'?

28:51.496 --> 28:52.998
Hello, ma'am.

28:53.699 --> 28:57.044
Martin Han, Rustin Cohle. State CID.

28:59.171 --> 29:00.775
This your place?

29:01.573 --> 29:03.075
It's my lease.

29:03.842 --> 29:06.118
What is this,
some kind of hillbilly bunny ranch?

29:06.211 --> 29:07.554
Excuse me?

29:07.713 --> 29:11.684
You might want to talk to Sheriff Biison
before you start tossing accusations around.

29:11.850 --> 29:13.761
No, I got nothing against hillbillies.

29:14.286 --> 29:16.926
Relax.
That's not why we're here. We, uh...

29:17.022 --> 29:21.801
Well' something happened lo a girl,
and we need to know if any of you knew her.

29:28.734 --> 29:30.407
Yeah. That's Dori.

29:32.404 --> 29:33.439
Something happened?

29:33.872 --> 29:36.546
You know about that woman
found outside of Erath?

29:39.044 --> 29:40.216
Oh, no.

29:41.880 --> 29:43.320
Did something happen to Dori?

29:47.419 --> 29:49.899
Were you pretty
good friends with her?

29:49.955 --> 29:52.902
She was nice to me when
I first came around.

29:53.892 --> 29:55.769
Gave me tips and stuff.

29:57.296 --> 29:59.469
Tips? About what?

30:04.569 --> 30:07.573
Nothing. You know, just how to be.

30:13.745 --> 30:17.420
You got any idea where she might
have been staying the last few weeks?

30:18.450 --> 30:19.690
I don't.

30:21.086 --> 30:22.861
Her ex is in prison.

30:23.588 --> 30:26.034
I guess maybe she got a new place.

30:27.359 --> 30:29.464
She'd been going to church.

30:30.095 --> 30:33.269
I was hoping
maybe she just turned things around.

30:36.268 --> 30:39.181
We're gonna need to question
any girls might have known her.

30:41.440 --> 30:43.943
That's a tougher ask than you think.

30:44.042 --> 30:46.454
Folks'll be staying away,
they hear y'all are out here.

30:46.511 --> 30:49.720
Well, ma'am,
it's the best way to get us to leave.

30:53.285 --> 30:56.630
- You said she left a bag?
- Yeah.

30:57.456 --> 30:58.901
Can I see it?

31:04.963 --> 31:06.067
Sure.

31:16.475 --> 31:18.182
That girl's not 18.

31:19.411 --> 31:22.153
Sheriff know you got underage working here?

31:22.381 --> 31:25.385
What do you know
about where that girl's been?

31:25.650 --> 31:27.391
Where she come from?

31:27.652 --> 31:29.654
You want to know Beth's situation,

31:29.988 --> 31:31.831
before she ran out on her uncle?

31:33.692 --> 31:36.229
There are other places she could go.

31:37.162 --> 31:39.938
Such holy bullshit from you.

31:41.099 --> 31:43.340
It's a woman's body, ain't it?

31:43.735 --> 31:44.873
A woman's choice.

31:45.170 --> 31:47.878
Well, she don't look like a woman to me.

31:48.707 --> 31:52.621
At that age, she is not equipped
to make those kind of choices.

31:53.745 --> 31:57.386
But I guess you don't give a shit
what kind of damage she's doing to herself

31:57.449 --> 31:58.928
as long as you're making your money.

31:59.017 --> 32:03.227
Girls walk this earth all the time
screwing for free.

32:04.189 --> 32:08.467
Now, why is it you add business to the mix,
and boys like you can't stand the thought?

32:08.560 --> 32:10.062
I'll tell you.

32:10.962 --> 32:15.035
