the way you thought you did.

32:18.737 --> 32:19.875
Ahem.

32:23.975 --> 32:25.921
Ma'am, you've both
been very helpful.

32:26.211 --> 32:27.588
We'll be in touch.

32:28.213 --> 32:31.820
Yes, thank you for your help.

32:43.061 --> 32:44.734
Do something else.

32:58.477 --> 32:59.615
That a down payment?

33:02.247 --> 33:06.923
