with the "poor me" little whiny bullshit?

44:13.584 --> 44:15.689
Is that what you're saying, hmm?

44:16.120 --> 44:18.930
That I'm trying to make
you feel bad for me?

44:19.757 --> 44:21.964
Is that really how you want to play this?

44:22.360 --> 44:23.998
No, honey.

44:24.095 --> 44:27.338
I think you're the
greatest woman I ever met,

44:27.498 --> 44:30.445
and you're the greatest thing
that ever happened to me.

44:30.501 --> 44:32.981
But, yeah, you know, sometimes

44:33.471 --> 44:37.977
I think you might have a penchant
for self-pity.

44:38.676 --> 44:42.522
