so that I can do my job.

44:45.550 --> 44:48.827
You have developed
some sort of selective deafness.

44:49.720 --> 44:52.360
You used to not be such a chicken shit,
I swear.

44:56.961 --> 44:59.134
Even your mom thinks you're a ball-buster.

45:09.073 --> 45:10.984
Tell the girls, dinner.

45:17.048 --> 45:18.493
Mmm.

45:25.089 --> 45:27.831
You don't have
a mommy or daddy anymore.

45:28.025 --> 45:30.335
