45:31.362 --> 45:32.432
How?

45:32.863 --> 45:35.002
In a car accident. Someone...

45:35.066 --> 45:37.603
Dinner-time, kids. Go to the kitchen.

45:38.402 --> 45:39.938
Are you coming?

45:40.371 --> 45:42.681
