45:43.374 --> 45:44.853
Yeah, really.

45:45.343 --> 45:46.413
Good.

46:00.725 --> 46:03.467
You know,
I think about my daughter now.

46:05.363 --> 46:06.740
And what...

46:08.266 --> 46:10.041
What she was spared.

46:13.704 --> 46:15.741
Sometimes I feel grateful.

46:21.712 --> 46:27.458
Doctors said she didn't feel a thing,
went straight into a coma.

46:29.387 --> 46:31.492
And then, somewhere in that

46:32.823 --> 46:35.565
