46:44.235 --> 46:46.841
Isn't that a beautiful way to go out?

46:49.407 --> 46:50.784
Painlessly.

46:52.410 --> 46:54.014
As a happy child.

46:56.347 --> 46:57.621
Hmm.

47:01.085 --> 47:05.534
Yeah, trouble with dying later
is you've already grown up.

47:06.490 --> 47:08.766
Damage is done. It's too late.

47:10.795 --> 47:12.035
You got kids?

47:13.998 --> 47:14.999
Mmm.

47:17.535 --> 47:21.950
I think of the hubris it must take to

47:23.674 --> 47:29.283
yank a soul out of nonexistence
into this meat.

47:31.982 --> 47:35.691
And to force a life into this thresher.

47:40.358 --> 47:42.634
And as for my daughter, she, uh...

47:44.729 --> 47:48.905
she spared me the sin of being a father.

47:50.468 --> 47:53.347
Hi, Cathleen, you little vixen.

47:54.505 --> 47:57.145
- Any chance of some coffee?
- Of course.

47:57.341 --> 47:58.479
Okay

