48:41.952 --> 48:43.260
But then, I'm from Texas.

48:46.190 --> 48:47.601
We're not stepping on your toes, Marty.

48:47.691 --> 48:50.433
We just got the mandate.
We got to compare notes with what you got.

48:50.528 --> 48:51.598
Yeah.

48:51.695 --> 48:53.766
- Here you are, Detective.
- No. Thanks, Cathleen.

48:53.864 --> 48:54.934
You got it.

48:55.032 --> 48:56.033
Xerox all you want.

48:57.701 --> 48:59.908
